  - id: help-reaping
    group: 0
    icon: {fileID: 5850598286787540372}
    title:
      key: help.reaping.title
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: Reaping & Returning
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.reaping.title
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    body:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "Carl reaps your character at the map's limit. The run ends; gathered resources and skill progress are kept.\n\nReturn to town to turn in quests. The Run Summary lists your gains and progress.\n\n<b>Map limits:</b> Statistics \u2192 General \u2192 select a map."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.reaping.body
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    details:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: Reaping at the limit increases distance by 1% on River, Woods, and Mines. Farmlands gives no increase. Spooky uses a kill limit instead of distance. Some quests also increase your reach.
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.reaping.details
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    illustrations:
    - sprite: {fileID: 5850598286787540372}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Carl
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.reaping.art.0
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: '<b>Carl</b>

          Carl ends the run at the map''s limit. You keep gathered resources and skill progress. River, Woods, and Mines gain 1% distance when you are reaped at the limit; Farmlands does not. Spooky uses kills instead of distance.'
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.reaping.art.0.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
