  - id: help-retreating
    group: 0
    icon: {fileID: -757387047, guid: 2d1ea1fa2e7dca4448ad7af961b8896b, type: 3}
    title:
      key: help.retreating.title
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: Retreat Bonus
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.retreating.title
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    body:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: '<b>Return:</b> use the return-to-town control during a run.


        Each kill adds 2% to your retreat resource bonus. The return control shows the current bonus.


        A return requested during combat is queued until the fight ends.'
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.retreating.body
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    details:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: The retreat bonus is based on kills earned during the current run. Reaping and retreating are different ways to end a run.
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.retreating.details
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    illustrations: []
    referenceColumns: []
    referenceRows: []
    expanded: 0
    visibility: []
  - id: help-forge
    group: 1
    icon: {fileID: 2895363419561144551}
    title:
      key: help.forge.title
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: Forge
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.forge.title
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    body:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "<b>Open:</b> Townsfolk \u2192 Forge, after meeting Ivan.\n\n<b>1. Smelt ingots</b> from the required materials.\n<b>2. Select a core.</b> It sets rarity odds and material costs.\n<b>3. Select a slot and Craft.</b> Each craft spends ingots and one core.\n<b>4. Compare the result.</b> Choose Equip to replace your current item.\n\nOutside Ivan's lesson, crafting for an empty slot equips the result automatically."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.forge.body
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    details:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "<b>Salvage</b>\nAn unused result is salvaged when you craft again or switch slots. Review it before continuing.\n\n<b>Automation \u2014 Forge mastery level 3</b>\nCraft Until Upgrade repeats crafting and spends materials each time.\nStop for Vastium stops on a Vastium result, even if it is a downgrade.\nStat Matching requires an upgrade to match your equipped item's affix types before stopping for that upgrade.\n\n<b>Core and crystal unlocks:</b> Hub \u2192 Skills \u2192 Combat."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.forge.details
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    illustrations:
    - sprite: {fileID: 8925258338319069828, guid: f84262455b69072498ba0e2afc130d21, type: 3}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Ingot
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.forge.art.0
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: '<b>Ingots</b>

          Smelt the materials shown by the ingot control. The selected core determines the ingot type and quantity required for a craft. Smelting creates materials; it does not create equipment.'
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.forge.art.0.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
    - sprite: {fileID: 791382025818577539, guid: 9a7553022bc32ea4cab234021aded58a, type: 3}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Core
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.forge.art.1
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: '<b>Cores</b>

          Each craft consumes one core. The selected core determines rarity odds and material costs. Combat levels unlock higher core tiers; upgrade cores using the Forge''s conversion controls.'
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.forge.art.1.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
    - sprite: {fileID: 5064720189575774579, guid: fffb6aee16bdecb4cb3248697c59ee9f, type: 3}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Sword
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.forge.art.2
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: '<b>Sword</b>

          Select Weapon, then Craft. Weapons guarantee a damage stat. Review the rolled bonuses and choose Equip to replace your current weapon. An unused result is salvaged when you craft again or switch slots.'
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.forge.art.2.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
    referenceColumns:
