  - id: help-buffs
    group: 2
    icon: {fileID: 7039786379928897746, guid: 6eca58ce81dde1648bbe834da736d225, type: 3}
    title:
      key: help.buffs.title
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: Buffs
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.buffs.title
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    body:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "<b>Open:</b> Hub \u2192 Buffs.\n\nBuffs provide temporary bonuses. Check the effect, cost, and duration before activating one. Buffs expire when their duration ends or you return to town.\n\nComplete a slot's required quest to unlock autocasting. Toggle autocasting from that slot."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.buffs.body
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    details:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: Eva's Cauldron provides buff cards that improve power and cooldowns.
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.buffs.details
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    illustrations:
    - sprite: {fileID: 7039786379928897746, guid: 6eca58ce81dde1648bbe834da736d225, type: 3}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Resource Doubler
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.buffs.art.0
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: "<b>Resource Doubler</b>\nA temporary resource-gathering buff. Check its displayed effect, cost, and duration in Hub \u2192 Buffs. Eligible slots can autocast after their required quests are completed."
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.buffs.art.0.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
    - sprite: {fileID: 7997396682134867387, guid: 27d08327615764bc9a976be93fb999d3, type: 3}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Task Speed
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.buffs.art.1
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: "<b>Task Speed</b>\nA temporary buff that speeds up task completion. Manage its slot and autocasting in Hub \u2192 Buffs. Buffs end when their duration expires or you return to town."
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.buffs.art.1.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
    referenceColumns: []
    referenceRows: []
    expanded: 0
    visibility:
    - condition: 0
      quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 18cb43a77b364b24fb75a31ff790efc5, type: 2}
      npcId:
  - id: help-cauldron
    group: 2
    icon: {fileID: -6316128909204395339, guid: de898b1a9190842419c92214290725b9, type: 3}
    title:
      key: help.cauldron.title
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: Cauldron
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.cauldron.title
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    body:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "<b>Open:</b> Townsfolk \u2192 Cauldron.\n\nMix food into stew, then taste the stew to receive cards. Check the displayed reward chances before tasting.\n\nResource cards increase matching resource yield. Buff cards improve buffs. Card levels are separate from resource rarity tiers."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.cauldron.body
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    details:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: 'A category uses the lowest card tier among its unlocked resources; unowned cards count as tier zero.


        Resource-card and category bonuses add together, up to 70%. They apply to gathering, enemy drops, and town crop harvests. Rewards, seeds, refunds, and conversions do not receive them.


        Complete all available resource and buff collections to unlock Eternal Boons.'
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.cauldron.details
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    illustrations:
    - sprite: {fileID: -6316128909204395339, guid: de898b1a9190842419c92214290725b9, type: 3}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Eva's Cauldron
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.cauldron.art.0
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: '<b>Cauldron</b>

          Choose food and a quantity to mix into stew. Taste stew to receive cards using the displayed reward chances. Resource cards improve matching resource yield; buff cards improve buffs. Reference lists resource-card and category thresholds.'
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.cauldron.art.0.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
