  - id: help-echoes
    group: 2
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 27afd0a9708dae942b5fcb9f60c65dff, type: 3}
    title:
      key: help.echoes.title
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: Echoes
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.echoes.title
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    body:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "Echoes are temporary copies of your character that gather resources or fight enemies.\n\nOrin's realms are connected. Spikes in temporal energy let Echoes of your past cross between them to help you. Helping the townsfolk earns you the power to summon Echoes at will.\n\nSkill milestone Echoes seek tasks belonging to that skill. Check Skills \u2192 Milestones or the summoning buff for its effects."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.echoes.body
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    details:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: An Echo with both task and combat abilities prioritizes tasks and fights when engaged.
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.echoes.details
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    illustrations:
    - sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 27afd0a9708dae942b5fcb9f60c65dff, type: 3}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Task Echo
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.echoes.art.0
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: '<b>Task Echo</b>

          Gathers resources without attacking or attracting enemies. Skill milestone Echoes seek tasks for that skill. The summoning buff or milestone specifies the Echo''s duration and abilities.'
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.echoes.art.0.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
    - sprite: {fileID: 7218046035808895280, guid: 16b9f4cabb88e55479fb4cb5a33be70d, type: 3}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Combat Echo
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.echoes.art.1
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: '<b>Combat Echo</b>

          Seeks and fights enemies. Combat-only Echoes do not gather resources. An Echo with both task and combat abilities prioritizes tasks and fights when engaged.'
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
