  - id: help-patchnotes
    group: 2
    icon: {fileID: -15454793016451926, guid: 1d379f5925be2cb4596f1d9b8ea6eab4, type: 3}
    title:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: Patch Notes
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.patchnotes.title
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    body:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "<b>Current development changes</b>\n\n<b>Opening and progression</b>\n\u2022 Reworked the opening quests and NPC introductions.\n\u2022 Gill leads players to the River; Barkley leads them toward the Woods.\n\u2022 Gill rewards Old Boots. Ivan supplies materials and teaches players to forge and equip their first sword.\n\u2022 Menus and tutorials appear as their systems become relevant.\n\u2022 Quests can only be turned in while in town.\n\n<b>Interface</b>\n\u2022 Redesigned the Run Summary and added a compact in-run Stats panel.\n\u2022 Inventory now shows equipped items and equipment bonuses.\n\u2022 Added drag scrolling throughout the interface.\n\u2022 Rebuilt the Library with topic navigation, reference tables, and selectable icon explanations.\n\n<b>Gameplay and fixes</b>\n\u2022 Reduced task density on the first Farmlands adventure.\n\u2022 Farming tasks appear only in Farmlands.\n\u2022 Core and crystal tiers unlock through Combat levels.\n\u2022 Fixed enemy health-bar overlays and fishing animation issues.\n\u2022 Removed leaderboards.\n\nSelect Reference for earlier patch notes."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.patchnotes.body
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    details:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "<b>Earlier patch notes</b>\n\n\u2022 Added For the Jam! and Gilliver's Travels.\n\u2022 Improved the introduction message.\n\u2022 Fixed level-up alerts showing lower values than expected.\n\u2022 Removed the Forge's Quality Equipped block.\n\u2022 Pinned quests show Ready to turn in instead of Complete.\n\u2022 Added a loading overlay when changing maps.\n\u2022 Added the Cauldron's Mix All button.\n\u2022 Updated the pathfinding package."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.patchnotes.details
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    illustrations: []
    referenceColumns: []
    referenceRows: []
    expanded: 0
    visibility: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
